<title>SOUTH AFRICA: GOLF-WORLD CUP OF GOLF EARLY FIRST ROUND SCORES.</title>
<headline>GOLF-WORLD CUP OF GOLF EARLY FIRST ROUND SCORES.</headline>
<dateline>SOMERSET WEST, South Africa 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Early completed round scores in the World Cup of Golf men's team tournament on Thursday:</p>
<p>139 Scotland (Andrew Coltart 70, Paul Lawrie 69)</p>
<p>143 Italy (Manuel Zerman 72, Costantino Rocca 71)</p>
<p>145 Germany  (Bernhard Langer 71, Alexander Cejka 74)</p>
<p>145 Switzerland (Andre Bossert 70 Paolo Quirici 75)</p>
<p>146 Namibia (Trevor Dodds 70, Schalk van der Merwe 76)</p>
<p>148 Mexico (Rafael Alarcon 75 Cesar Perez 73)</p>
<p>150 Puerto Rico (Miguel Suarez 74, Wilfredo Morales 76)</p>
<p>154 Jamaica (Delroy Cambridge 72, Seymour Rose 82)</p>
<p>142 Argentina (Ricardo Gonzalez 71, Jorge Alberto Berendt 71)</p>
<p>143 Wales (Ian Woosnam 70, Mark Mouland 73) </p>
<p>145 Ireland (Darren Clarke 71, Padraig Harrington 74), Spain (Diego Borrego 71,Ignacio Garrido 74)</p>
<p>149 England (Jim Payne 71, Peter Mitchell 78), Sweden (Jarmo Sandelin 74, Patrik Sjoland 75)</p>
<p>150 Chile (Guillermo Encine 77, Roy Mackenzie 73)</p>
<p>151 Zimbabwe (Mark McNulty 72, Tony Johnstone 79)</p>
